kenogenesis/paths.py and kenogenesis/errors.py are adapted from the local
Kosmokrator project (Dwemer Dynamics), under GPLv3. The core, adapters and browser
also use its shared-core, guarded-edit, local-reference and safe-export design.
The browser shell and component stylesheet are ported from Kosmokrator, with
KENOGENESIS palette tokens and CoE5 adapters. images.py adapts its TGA/PNG handling.
No private mods, demo nations, artwork or extracted game data were copied.

