CoE5 command signatures and documented limits were researched against:
  Illwinter Game Design, Conquest of Elysium 5 Modding Manual, version 5.36
  https://www.illwinter.com/coe5/coe5modding.pdf
The manual is not bundled. The command reference index includes documented
names, signatures, page locations and short manual descriptions; UI labels and
curated validation are maintained separately. No engine simulation is implied.

CoE5 5.41 additions are recorded from release notes, not from the manual:
  Illwinter Game Design (johan), "Conquest of Elysium 5.41", Steam news, 19 Oct 2026
  Steam ISteamNews/GetNewsForApp, appid 1606340, gid 1846651706689977
  https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689977
The official manual available on that date was still version 5.36. The announced
command names carry no documented signature; the custom terrain range 500-1999 is
inferred from the announced terrain slot total.
